  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-maroon pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Blood Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f7/DIO_Absorbs_Joseph%27s_Blood_%28JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_OVA%29.gif/revision/latest?cb=20251210174807\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DIO Absorbs Joseph&#39;s Blood (JoJo&#39;s Bizarre Adventure OVA)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f7/DIO_Absorbs_Joseph%27s_Blood_%28JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_OVA%29.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20251210174807\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f7/DIO_Absorbs_Joseph%27s_Blood_%28JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_OVA%29.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20251210174807 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f7/DIO_Absorbs_Joseph%27s_Blood_%28JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_OVA%29.gif/revision/latest?cb=20251210174807 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DIO Absorbs Joseph&#39;s Blood (JoJo&#39;s Bizarre Adventure OVA)\" width=\"270\" height=\"208\" data-image-key=\"DIO_Absorbs_Joseph%27s_Blood_%28JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_OVA%29.gif\" data-image-name=\"DIO Absorbs Joseph&#39;s Blood (JoJo&#39;s Bizarre Adventure OVA).gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Dio Brando/DIO (JoJo's Bizarre Adventure) absorbing Joseph Jostar in his Awakened state.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb blood.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Last night there were all these people half-drunk.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Where did they find all the alcohol?\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"No. They've been \"Half-Drunk\". Please finish a whole victim before moving on to the next one, k?</i>\"<i></i></dd>\n<dd>― Laszlo and Nandor (What We Do In The Shadows)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb blood and utilize it in some way</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Manipulation\" title=\"Blood Manipulation\">Blood Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Consumption\" title=\"Blood Consumption\">Blood Consumption</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Draining\" title=\"Vampiric Draining\">Vampiric Draining</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Haemokinetic Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb blood, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently. Depending how this power is used, it can be excruciatingly painful or even lethal.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Empowerment\" title=\"Blood Empowerment\">Blood Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Removal\" title=\"Blood Removal\">Blood Removal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Haemopotent_Regeneration\" title=\"Haemopotent Regeneration\">Haemopotent Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">Death Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pain_Inducement\" title=\"Pain Inducement\">Pain Inducement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Consumption\" title=\"Blood Consumption\">Blood Consumption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Assimilation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Biological Assimilation\">Biological Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Manipulation\" title=\"Blood Manipulation\">Blood Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dehydration\" title=\"Dehydration\">Dehydration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Haemopotent_Replication\" title=\"Haemopotent Replication\">Haemopotent Replication</a> by absorbing the blood of superpowered beings.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a> by draining their blood.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only</li>\n<li>May need to absorbing drink or ingest blood to survive\n<ul><li>If they stopped absorbing blood for an extend amount of time, their powers/abilities may weaken when they haven't absorbed blood for a while</li></ul></li>\n<li>Absorption of blood may not make the user stronger</li>\n<li>May be limited to the amount of blood they can absorb, and need to expel the blood while absorbing in order to continue</li>\n<li>If the target's blood contains something the user is vulnerable to, they are essentially absorbing it directly</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://basilisk.fandom.com/wiki/Okoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Basilisk:Okoi\">Okoi</a> (<i>Basilisk</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bloodplusanime.fandom.com/wiki/Queens\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bloodplus:Queens\">Chiropteran Queens</a> (<i>Blood+</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://bloodplusanime.fandom.com/wiki/Diva\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bloodplus:Diva\">Diva</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bloodplusanime.fandom.com/wiki/Saya_Otonashi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bloodplus:Saya Otonashi\">Saya Otonashi</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bloodplusanime.fandom.com/wiki/Chiropterans\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bloodplus:Chiropterans\">Chiropterans</a> (<i>Blood+</i>)</li>\n<li>Hunters &amp; Huntresses (<i>Bloodborne</i>)</li>\n<li>Blood Bag users (<i>The Citadel</i>)</li>\n<li>The Oni (<i>Dead by Daylight</i>)</li>\n<li>The Countess (<i>Diablo Immortal</i>)</li>\n<li>John Doe (<i>Embalming: The Tale of Another Frankenstein</i>)</li>\n<li>Vampires (<i>Folklore/Fiction</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hellsing.fandom.com/wiki/Alucard\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Hellsing:Alucard\">Alucard</a> (<i>Hellsing</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hellsing.fandom.com/wiki/Seras_Victoria\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Hellsing:Seras Victoria\">Seras Victoria</a> (<i>Hellsing</i>); upon becoming a Real Vampire</li>\n<li>Herrscher of the Toxin (<i>Honkai Impact 3rd</i>)</li>\n<li>Blood-Addled/Hemogoblins (<i>INCISION</i>)</li>\n<li>Kitty (<i>INCISION</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legend-of-the-northern-blade.fandom.com/wiki/Jo_Un-Kyung\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:legend-of-the-northern-blade:Jo Un-Kyung\">Jo Un-Kyung</a> (<i>Legend of the Northern Blade</i>)</li>\n<li>Vampires (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>)\n<ul><li>DIO Brando</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://kill-la-kill.fandom.com/wiki/Senketsu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Kill-la-kill:Senketsu\">Senketsu</a> (<i>Kill la Kill</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://kill-la-kill.fandom.com/wiki/Junketsu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Kill-la-kill:Junketsu\">Junketsu</a> (<i>Kill la Kill</i>)</li>\n<li>Mondo Zappa (<i>Killer is Dead</i>)</li>\n<li>Vlad (<i>League of Legends</i>)</li>\n<li>Peta (<i>Marchen Awakens Romance</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Crocodile\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Onepiece:Crocodile\">Crocodile</a> (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li>Pokémon that can use \"Leech Life\" (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vampirehunterd.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Vampirehunterd:Vampire\">Vampire</a> (<i>Vampire Hunters</i>)</li>\n<li>Sanguine (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://takamagahara.fandom.com/wiki/Doumoto_Hitoshi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Takamagahara:Doumoto Hitoshi\">Jin</a> (<i>Takama-ga-hara</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-55151\">SCP-5151 - The Black Knight</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://splatterhouse.fandom.com/wiki/Rick_Taylor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Splatterhouse:Rick Taylor\">Rick Taylor</a> (<i>Splatterhouse</i>)</li>\n<li>Machines (<i>Ultrakill</i>)\n<ul><li>V1</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlood_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Trick Weapons and Guns (<i>Bloodborne</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Stone_Mask\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Stone Mask\">Stone Masks</a> (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>)</li>\n<li>Gekkou (<i>Killer is Dead</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Kubikirib%C5%8Dch%C5%8D\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Naruto:Kubikiribōchō\">Kubikiribōchō</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Shichiseiken\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Onepiece:Shichiseiken\">Shichiseiken</a> (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li>Blood Collector (<i>Resident Evil</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sp